@host = http://localhost:5219

### NOTE: PlayersController currently has no POST/create endpoint.
### Only GET, PATCH, and DELETE exist for Players. Use the ScoutingSource
### POST below first (a source is required before a player can exist),
### then insert players manually via the DB, or add a POST endpoint
### to PlayersController if you want to create players through the API.

### Create a scouting source (required to associate players with)
POST {{host}}/api/scouting-sources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Source"
}

###

### Get all players (default paging)
GET {{host}}/api/players
Accept: application/json

###

### Get players with filters, sorting, and paging
GET {{host}}/api/players?position=Forward&sortBy=marketvalue_desc&pageNumber=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a single player by id
GET {{host}}/api/players/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Update (partial) a player
PATCH {{host}}/api/players/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estimatedMarketValue": 120.0,
  "availabilityStatus": "Transfer Target"
}

###

### Delete a player
DELETE {{host}}/api/players/3

###

### Get all scouting sources (with their players included)
GET {{host}}/api/scouting-sources
Accept: application/json

###

### Get the club summary
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/club-summary
Accept: application/json

### Get the Position Summary
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/position-summary
Accept: application/json

###